{"uid":"84eb89f8df3d59a4","name":"test_a_finding_expands_and_collapses_via_its_own_summary","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub_parked#test_a_finding_expands_and_collapses_via_its_own_summary","historyId":"4f22e14bdc14e07b697c841b8f41ed5c","time":{"start":1791942567209,"stop":1791942576346,"duration":9137},"description":"`.parked-finding` is a native `<details>` -- clicking its `<summary>`\n    toggles `.open`, and (the real behavioural proof, not just the\n    attribute) the browser's own default stylesheet hides the collapsed\n    body from `innerText` (which respects rendering) while `textContent`\n    would not have -- so \"evidence one\" is absent from the rendered page\n    text until the finding is expanded, and gone again once collapsed.","descriptionHtml":"<p><code>.parked-finding</code> is a native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> -- clicking its <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code><br />\ntoggles <code>.open</code>, and (the real behavioural proof, not just the<br />\nattribute) the browser's own default stylesheet hides the collapsed<br />\nbody from <code>innerText</code> (which respects rendering) while <code>textContent</code><br />\nwould not have -- so &quot;evidence one&quot; is absent from the rendered page<br />\ntext until the finding is expanded, and gone again once collapsed.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791941605405,"stop":1791941605405,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791941605406,"stop":1791941605406,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isol